  "description": "And one theme continues to dominate the rankings...",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Wednesday! Stock market is showing signs of life again, and we are seeing several individual names bounce upwards, with volume. These are great signs. Friendly reminder, not all stocks go “strait up”… sometimes you have to sit through some chop. Nothing “broke” the last few days, and we remain in a clear technical bull market…as annoying as it can be sometimes. </p><p>This is Midweek Movers, where I rank your favorite stocks from worst to first 🥇</p><p>You may have seen me talk about PBF Energy yesterday. PBF first appeared on the <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">StockTok Screener</a></strong> May 5th, up 74% since then. It was shared on July 14th and was a Midweek Mover winner, up over 20% since then. Not trying to gloat…the main point here is:</p><ol><li><p>Don’t be afraid of a stock that is “up”. Trend is friend. </p></li><li><p>The screener and midweek movers has a strong track record of finding winning stocks. (Ok, maybe a little gloating 😅)</p></li></ol><p>This week we had 36 tickers to sort through. Just because your ticker did not win, does not mean it is bad or can’t go up! It just means, I think that the winning stocks have a higher percent chance of going up. We want <em><strong>all the odds in our favor</strong></em>. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><h4>The top 3 stocks all look like buys today. </h4><div><hr></div><h4>Stocks at the Bottom of the Barrel</h4><p>When I review this list, I am looking to immediately chop stocks. And the very first thing I do, is <strong>eliminate the stocks that have price action below the 200 day moving average.</strong> You cannot hit a local high, a 52 week high, or an all time high… <strong>in the near term</strong>… if price is below there. Period. I want winners, <em><strong>NOW</strong></em>. </p><p>Here, I eliminated Inspire Medical Systems, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$INSP&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>;  Lightwave Logic, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$LWLG&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>;  Regal Rexnord Corp, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RRX&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>;  USA Rare Earth, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$USAR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>;  Vistra Corp, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$VST&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; and  Zoetis, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$ZTS&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>.  </p><div><hr></div><h4>Trend is Friend</h4><p>Many of these stocks are going up. But they are going up less, relative to the S&amp;P 500. I want a strong trend, with momentum. Institutional money pushing these stocks upwards. You can help yourself to <a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/script/D62aWpQ5-Tim-s-Pump-Machine/\">my personally built indicator</a>. But you will notice there is a table at the bottom of the chart…in that table, in one cell it says “RS rating &gt;70”, and it will be red, yellow or green. This just tells me how that asset is trending, relative to the S&amp;P 500. I do not want weaker trends…not that they are bad…but they are weaker, relative to this list of stocks. Here, I eliminated 18 stocks with weaker trends. Anything below 65, was cut. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!llTC!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!llTC!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!llTC!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!llTC!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!llTC!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!llTC!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png\" width=\"230\" height=\"454\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:454,&quot;width&quot;:230,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:16025,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/213851505?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!llTC!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!llTC!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!llTC!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!llTC!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fff2c7869-92f9-457d-92e8-d82100e8017b_230x454.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><hr></div><h4>Fundamentals</h4><p>Interestingly, the top 9  remaining stocks all had “Good” fundamentals, meaning they had improving cashflow and improved EPS. Remitly, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;RELY&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> declined annually, but had substantial improvement from Q1 2026 to Q2 2026.   So because we are trying to find <em><strong>the best</strong></em>, I eliminated 3 stocks with the least amount of improvement. Stocks with consistently positive or explosive growth, are going to provide higher probability odds that it will happen again, increasing our chances for profit. </p><p>Joint Stock Company, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$KSPI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>;  Remitly, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RELY&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> and Insight Enterprises, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NSIT&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> were cut from the finalists podium. Special note about RELY, that chart is showing strong bottoming features on the macro timeframe. That one is worth watching. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HMI!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7175d72b-c1b4-40e2-b705-646b09700ad5_1431x820.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HMI!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7175d72b-c1b4-40e2-b705-646b09700ad5_1431x820.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HMI!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7175d72b-c1b4-40e2-b705-646b09700ad5_1431x820.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HMI!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7175d72b-c1b4-40e2-b705-646b09700ad5_1431x820.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HMI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7175d72b-c1b4-40e2-b705-646b09700ad5_1431x820.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HMI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7175d72b-c1b4-40e2-b705-646b09700ad5_1431x820.png\" width=\"1431\" height=\"820\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7175d72b-c1b4-40e2-b705-646b09700ad5_1431x820.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height